# NOEZEMA evaluation corpus v4 (EVAL-5, see EVAL-5-freeze.md §2.2)
# 55 questions: 34 verbatim from corpus v2 + 13 verbatim from corpus v3
# (inherited lines are byte-identical to the frozen originals; v2 sha256
# 93c1a93a…, v3 sha256 20db6f0d… re-checked at v4 build) + 8 new questions
# for EVAL-5 (fact kinds: versions, office-holders, support dates; all
# relative «на текущую дату»; 2 independent sources per question, values
# verified in both pages by live GET — corpus-v4-liveverify.json;
# pairwise token-Jaccard strictly < 0.6 on all slices new-new / new-vs-v2 /
# new-vs-v3, maxima 0.5714 / 0.5200 / 0.5926).
#
# T7.31 composition decision (EVAL-5-freeze.md §2.2/§3): under T7.30 /
# ADR-0016 every relative question gets as_of = session start (UTC) →
# fresh at run end (run < 30d), every explicit-date question keeps the
# explicit date. All dateless questions are EXCLUDED from v4 (v2: Python
# old-as_of, 7 «Повтори и подтверди» re-verifies, PostgreSQL 14 EOL,
# Constitution, ISO 4217, HTTP 404, Sputnik, planets; v3: 3 T-old @
# 2026-06-01, 3 dateless T-date) → zero model-as_of exposure in the
# temporal pool; designed due-claims at run end = 2 (K = 2): the two kept
# old-as_of questions (UN @ 2026-04-15, EU @ 2026-01-01).
# Dropped from v2 as well: the Rublyovo pack (lines 10 + 28) — the two
# designated sources conflict since the 2026-09-05 opening (5 stations
# opened per msk.kp.ru vs the 14-station first section on stroi.mos.ru).
#
# Format: one JSON object per line: {"text": ..., "priority": N}.
# '#' lines are skipped by hostctl eval-run; lines are deduped by exact text.
# Priority 100: 2 old-as_of questions (as_of in the past → reverify_after
#   in the past → due at the end: the g6 designed numerator, K = 2).
# Priority 90: 10 pack anchors (6 URL-backed + 4 workspace-file).
# Priority 80: 14 pack follow-ups (6 relative URL + 8 workspace-file) —
#   run only after every anchor is committed (FIFO: priority DESC,
#   created_at ASC, id), so each follow-up session can see the anchor claim.
# Priority 0: 29 standalone (8 relative v2 + 13 relative v3 + 8 new).
